{"id":"n71275-2-2","stage":1,"title":"사실 · 事实上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71275-2-2-1","ko":"대체 누가 내 허락도 없이 여기 있던 사과를 먹은 거야!","zh":"到底是谁没经过我允许就吃了放在这里的苹果啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟。","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"허락도","meaning":"允许，许可，准许，应许，答应","explanation":"허락：允许，许可，准许，应许，答应；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"허락","audio":"/audio/9986581756f7eef479ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86945","senseId":"1","lemma":"허락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허락도","audio":"/audio/435e9e82e3046a0cc6aa.mp3"}},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有。","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"6","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionar